      },
      "description": "The platform UI sub-graph — a NAMED SUB-GRAPH of the harness, OPT-IN like `sdlc`: off in every layer unless that layer lists `cat-harness.platform-ui` in its own `enableSubgraphs` (owner, 2026-11-10, card Q-SG-1 C, wave 3). It holds the `platform-ui` skill package: how the harness's own site and viewers are built and themed (PDF inline viewer, visualiser loading, incremental rendering, HTML rendering QC, deployment awareness, theme declaration, generation, contrast and artefacts, sticky notes). The viewers, the site Tools and the skills always-on content cites stay in `ui-core`, `theming` and `tools/`, because sites a layer publishes still use them. Declared FROM WITHIN in `platform-ui/graph.json`.",
